</div></div></div><div class="pf-c pf-sm-hide pf-hide" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-15_ pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-knuQPt exJdfU pf-16_ pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-18_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Check Discount Now</span></span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-116e" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-pKreJ kztRcD pf-19_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-djTQOc ejtSSi"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-20_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-21_"><h1 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-dJjagV faqBYR pf-22_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-24_">I Tested A Device That Saves You Hours By Automatically Finding &amp; Backing Up Your Photos And Videos With ONE Click… But I Never Expected This!</span></h1></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-536f" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-pKreJ kztRcD pf-25_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-djTQOc ejtSSi"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-26_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-27_"><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-cMa-dPg sc-fUBjpT dmUhBZ dwZasy pf-28_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Guilherme_Review_16x9-25.36_1200x.png?v=1775690852" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Guilherme_Review_16x9-25.36.png?v=1775690852 1536w" width="1920" height="1080" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="TPSO X_Guilherme Review_16x9-25.36.png__PID:0ced5e71-2362-4d6b-bee4-5cade02bd6e8"/></a><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-dJjagV faqBYR pf-29_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-31_"><span style="font-style: italic;">Do you have a lot of photos and videos stored on your computer and/or phone? Read this article closely… it could prevent a tragedy!</span></span></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-119b" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-pKreJ kztRcD pf-32_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-djTQOc ejtSSi"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-33_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-34_"><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-35_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-7c34e17e-046a-465e-b76b-cd2c9e60e97f"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">As a computer repair technician, I get desperate phone calls from customers every day.<br><br>They usually sound something like this:<br><br><i>“PLEASE help me! I put my phone on the hood of the car for one second and forgot about it when I drove away. </i><b><i>Now it won’t turn on… and I have YEARS of family photos on there.” </i></b><br><br>Or… “<i>I don’t know what happened. I was on my computer playing solitaire when <b>the screen suddenly turned black…</b> I’m afraid to touch it. I JUST moved my vacation photos with my grandchildren to my computer and deleted them off my phone… is there any hope?”</i><br><br>Of course, <b>I tell all my customers to “ALWAYS BACK UP” – but hardly any of them do.</b> And honestly, I understand why – it takes a TON of effort to back up all your most important files!<br><br>First, you have to dig through all those folders across ALL your devices… then organize all your photos and videos… and then you have to go through each file and figure out which ones you’re going to back up, removing the duplicates you’ve already backed up in the past. You can easily spend hundreds of hours going through everything!<br><br>We’d all rather spend our free time doing just about anything else. But get this: <b>140,000 hard drives crash EVERY WEEK in the United States alone…</b><br><br>And as a result, about <b>46% of internet users lose their files every year.</b></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-cMa-dPg sc-fUBjpT dmUhBZ dwZasy pf-38_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/English_1200x.png?v=1772048573" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/English.png?v=1772048573 1536w" width="1050" height="600" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="English.png__PID:5fbd776d-f338-4019-b4f9-782184a80b08"/></a><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-39_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-ea88f40b-37dd-4068-a5c9-4d3a594d2b35"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><b>That’s millions of precious memories… lost forever.<br></b><br>To recover them, you either have to figure it out on your own… or pay a technician like me $300 - $500 with no guarantees!<br><br>I get dozens of calls for this every week… and very few end well.<br><br>So naturally, I was MORE than a bit skeptical when my friend called to say he had found <b>a one-of-a-kind gadget that does all your backups FOR YOU… on ALL your devices…</b> and it saves them in ONE secure physical location.<br><br>It sounded unbelievable. I had seen my fair share of flimsy thumb drives and “unhackable” cloud-based services—that just get hacked 2 weeks later.<br><br>But, I decided to test out this new device anyway… mostly to make my friend happy.<br><br>And I was SHOCKED when I discovered that it <b>ACTUALLY WORKS — and it’s both SECURE &amp; EASY</b> to use. Let me explain…<b></b></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-ebda" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-pKreJ kztRcD pf-42_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-djTQOc ejtSSi"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-43_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-44_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-dJjagV faqBYR pf-45_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-47_">What Is This New Easy-to-Use Backup Gadget?
</span></h2><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-cMa-dPg sc-fUBjpT dmUhBZ dwZasy pf-48_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X__Guilherme_Unboxing_16x9-37.10_1200x.png?v=1775690884" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X__Guilherme_Unboxing_16x9-37.10.png?v=1775690884 1536w" width="1920" height="1080" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="TPSO X _Guilherme Unboxing_16x9-37.10.png__PID:f323bb83-68a2-4213-b5ae-4352122fa06c"/></a><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-49_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-22d13732-6e45-4fd2-809a-267eb3c36802"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><b>It’s called <a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self"><strong>ThePhotoStick Omni X</strong></a>.<br></b><br>It’s a revolutionary device that automatically <b>finds, sorts, and saves up to 200,000 photos and videos across ANY of your devices</b> with just ONE click.<br><br>Even better, you only need one of them for all your devices! ThePhotoStick Omni works on:<br>• All Windows computers<br>• All Mac (Apple) computers<br>• All smartphones (iPhones, Android, iOS, etc.)<br>• All tablets (Galaxy, iPad, etc.)<br><br>This means you can now safely store, access, and share ALL of your precious photo and video memories in a matter of minutes… no matter where they are… with ONE device. It’s going to prevent so many irreplaceable photos &amp; videos from being lost!<b></b></span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-52_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-53_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-dJjagV faqBYR pf-54_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-56_">How Does <u><a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self">ThePhotoStick Omni X</a></u> Work?
</span></h2><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-57_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-64dcd259-ecc7-48ae-8e9d-06d4d84ef635"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><b></b>This is where I was pleasantly surprised. <b>Most backup systems are WAY too complicated for the average user… which results in a lot of tragic mistakes.</b><br><br>Not only do backups take a LONG time, <b>one little mistake can cause all those precious memories to be erased.</b> And digging through your folders to find all those files is always a nightmare… you’ll never know if you missed an important photo or video until it’s too late.<br><br>But that’s what makes ThePhotoStick Omni different. It does everything FOR YOU in just 3 simple steps:<br><br><strong>STEP 1:</strong> Plug the stick into ANY device that has your photos or videos.<b></b></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-cMa-dPg sc-fUBjpT dmUhBZ dwZasy pf-60_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Guilherme_Review_16x9-4.73_1200x.png?v=1775690931" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Guilherme_Review_16x9-4.73.png?v=1775690931 1536w" width="1920" height="1080" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="TPSO X_Guilherme Review_16x9-4.73.png__PID:2179c490-9786-438a-9fda-f55cf9566ad8"/></a><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-61_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-c83129ff-da37-4ea8-aa16-0b7235043cc5"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><b></b><strong>NOTE: </strong>It has four different plugs that will fit onto any computer, phone, or tablet – even if it doesn’t have a USB slot.<b></b></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-cMa-dPg sc-fUBjpT dmUhBZ dwZasy pf-64_"><img src="https://cdn.s